stcc (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add fixed-address ROM linking with independent ROM and RAM placement.
  * Add original-ST bootstrap, DATA/BSS initialization, vectors and stack.
  * Add standalone C video example and cold-boot tests without external TOS.
  * Install the ROM bootstrap/documentation and verify packaged ROM generation.

 -- EFRITS <contact@efrits.fr>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:30:00 +0000

stcc (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Separate clean from fclean and remove generated test traces and temporaries.
  * Install optional tos/ contents into /usr/share/stcc/tos with the package.
  * Use fclean in debhelper and verify staged ROM data installation.

 -- EFRITS <contact@efrits.fr>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0000

stcc (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add native stmkdisk: standalone FAT12 .ST floppy image creation.
  * Import recursive directories, explicit 8.3 paths and AUTO programs.
  * Add disk checks and real floppy read/write tests under Hatari/EmuTOS.
  * Install both binaries and their manual pages.

 -- EFRITS <contact@efrits.fr>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000

stcc (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add C89 int bit fields, layout, initialization and partial updates.
  * Add __interrupt__ full-context entry/RTE and __naked__ raw entry bodies.
  * Add nested exception, raw chaining and deferred VBL examples and tests.
  * Keep floating point and by-value aggregate calls outside the current scope.

 -- EFRITS <contact@efrits.fr>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0000

stcc (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial standalone 68000 / TOS compiler and Devpac assembler.
  * Integer C89 subset, inline Devpac, internal objects and TOS relocation.
  * Runtime, examples, CPU regression tests and optional Hatari tests.

